          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yakobo kūja kū ng'wa Labani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 28:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Isaka ūng'witana ū Yakobo ūmfuuha, ūng'hūgūla alīng'wīla gīkī, “Yaya gete ū kūtoola nkīma wa mu Kanaani ūmu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.28.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.28.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 28:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jaga Padani-alamu kū ng'wa gūkūyo Betueli, ūkatoolele kwenūko; ū nkīma ūkūpandīkīla ha ng'wa mamiyo Labani, ū nsīzaye wa noko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.28.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.28.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 28:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Mulungu Ndūji wa shose,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.28.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.28.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28:3",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Mulungu Ndūji wa shose:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Shiheb, Eli-shadai.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " wei ng'wenekīlī akwīlūkīle mbango, na akwīte kūbiza na būbyīle būtaale, hangī akongeje no no no, kūshisha ūbize ihanga lya banhū bingī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.28.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.28.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 28:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akwinhe ī ja ng'wa Abulahamu, ū bebe hamò nū būbyīle wako; wīdime ī sī īyo Mulungu akang'winha Abulahamu, īyo ūkwikalaga muyo gītī ūlī nobeji, ībize yako ya wikomangīle.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.28.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.28.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 28:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū Isaka ūnaga ū Yakobo, ūbūūka ajile Padani-alamu kū ng'wa Labani ng'witūnja wa ng'wa Betueli muna Alamu, ū nsīzaye wa ng'wa Lebbeka, ū nina wa ba Yakobo na Esau.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.28.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.28.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 28:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.28.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.28.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 28:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Esau ūbona gīkī ū Isaka wamfuuha ū Yakobo, ūntūma Padani-alamu kūjūtoolela kwenūko, ūmfuuha alīnagīla akūng'wīlaga, “Ūtizūtoola nkīma wa Kanaani.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.28.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.28.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 28:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūmona wabiigwa a ba ise nū nina, ūja ng'hana ī Padani-alamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.28.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.28.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 28:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A henaho ū Esau ūdeeba hape gīkī, a bakīma ba Kanaani baalī batanyegije ū ise, ū Isaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.28.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.28.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 28:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ūja kū ng'wa Ishimaeli ng'witūnja wa ng'wa Abulahamu, ūkantoola Mahalati, nshīke wa ng'wa Ishimaeli; ūyo wal'ilūmbūye wa ng'wa Nebaiyoti. Ūbiza ongeja nkīma ūngī a bake abo walī nabo kūfuma kale.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.28.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.28.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Shilooti sha ng'wa Yakobo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 28:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.28.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.28.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 28:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yakobo ūbūūka kwīnga ī Beeli-sheba, ūgumha ajile Halani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.28.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.28.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 28:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūshika ipandī ilebe ūlenda henaho, nguno ī līīmi līkagwa; aho wila ū būjikū ūsola iwe lyalī bbihī henaho ūlītūūla ū kū ntwe ūliisagūja gītī nsago, ūlaala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.28.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.28.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 28:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwimanīla waloota shilooti alībona ngaji ītūūlilwe ha sī, alīyo īkuumije ng'wigūlū; na bamalaika ba ng'wa Mulungu bakwītūmamīlaga kūlinha na kwika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.28.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.28.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 28:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū kwigūlya ya ngaji yenīyo, walīko ū SEEBA īmīīlile; ūhaya gīkī, “Ū nene nalī SEEBA, Mulungu wa ng'wa Abulahamu ntaale wako, na Mulungu wa ng'wa so Isaka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.28.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.28.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28:13",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Wa ng'wa Abulahamu ntaale wako, na Mulungu wa ng'wa so Isaka:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Shiheb, wa ng'wa so Abulahamu, na Mulungu wa ng'wa Isaka.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ī sī yenīyī aho walaalaga nakūkwinha bebe hamò nū būbyīle wako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.28.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.28.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 28:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū būbyīle wako būkūbiza na banhū bingī gītī lūbuubu lwa ha sī, hama ūkūtana",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.28.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.28.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28:14",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ūkūtana:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ūkūgalīha 53.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ūsambaale hose hose, ng'weli, kīya, sukuma na dakama. Pye a banhū ba mu sī bakwanukūla kūbītīla mulī bebe na būbyīle wako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.28.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.28.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 28:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakūbiza hamò nang'ho, nīyo nakūkūlang'hana būlī kwene ūko ūkūja. Hanuma nakūkūshosha hangī ū mu sī yenīyī. Natīko kūkūleka, kūshisha nīshikīlīje īyo nalīkwisagīja.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.28.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.28.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 28:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.28.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.28.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 28:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yakobo aho wabbamhuka ū mu tūlo yakwe, wandya kwiganika gīkī, “Ī gete ū SEEBA alīho a h'ipandī lyenīlī, nūūlū īkī naalī natamanile ū nene.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.28.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.28.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 28:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akogoha no; ūhaya, “Ī lipandī lyenīlī līlī na lyoogohya itaale; ī lyenīlī lītūbiza ipandī līngī lyose lyose, ūlū ītī numba ya ng'wa Mulungu, a henaha hū a ha mita gwa kwingīlīla ng'wigūlū!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.28.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.28.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 28:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī ntondo yaaho ī dilū, ū Yakobo ūbūūka ūlīsola ī liwe īlo walī walītūūla kū ntwe ūliisagūla; ūlyīmīlīja gītī ng'hīngī, hūna ūliitīīla maguta a higūlya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.28.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.28.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 28:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī lipandī lyenīlo ūlitana Beeseli",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.28.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.28.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28:19",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Beeseli:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Makūlū gaho, Numba ya ng'wa Mulungu.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " nūūlū īkī ū nzengo gwa kwenūko gwitanagwa Luzi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.28.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.28.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 28:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Yakobo ūlahīla alīhaya gīkī, “Ū Mulungu ūlū ūbiza hamò nū nene, ūnilang'hana nū mu lūgendo ūlo nalīīja lwenūlū, ūninha na shilīwa hamò na shizwalo sha kūzwala, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.28.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.28.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 28:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kūshisha nashoke kū kaya ya ng'wa baba nalī mhola, ū SEEBA akūbiza Mulungu wane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.28.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.28.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 28:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A h'iwe īlo naalītūūla lyīmīīla gītī ng'hīngī lyenīlī, īkūbiza ho numba ya ng'wa Mulungu; nū mu shose īsho ūkūninha, nakūkwinha īmò ya ng'wikūmi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.28.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.28.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
